//にあったような気がするんだけど……
//　気のせいかしら？」
"I feel like there's something I should be doing here, something that could cost Yuhi a few kidneys... or is it my imagination?"

pt:
//【小夏】
<voice name='小夏' class='小夏' src='voice/ma01/0031430b33'>
//「……ていうか、そんなことよりも決定的に
