"We caught a puppet show at Hachiman Shrine," Konatsu recalls, staring at the ceiling. Her faculties appear to be recovering, if slowly. "Then we split up."

pt:
//【小夏】
<voice name='小夏' class='小夏' src='voice/ma01/0031730b33'>
//「確か昨日は八幡宮で人形劇を見て、そこで
//解散したのよね」
